{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e07bd6006945d27fc141","chatId":"4ed70bb644a14b40815465cab6c2a07a","sessionId":null,"userId":51222,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[D]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[D]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":915,"promptTokens":1511,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:26:51"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0021823927365160435,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e07bd6006945d27fc140","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367611532,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:26:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e07bd6006945d27fc140","chatId":"4ed70bb644a14b40815465cab6c2a07a","sessionId":null,"userId":51222,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n晚间，妈妈在厨房做饭，小明以及育儿嫂正围坐在餐桌旁吃饭。小明抓起一块鱼，举在半空中，眉头紧锁，鱼肉里有很多刺。妈妈注意到了小明的动作，她看了看小明，吼了一声，然后看向专心吃饭的育儿嫂。育儿嫂听到喊声后有些惊讶，她看向小明，让小明把抓起的鱼放了回去。\n\n[问题]\n你认为育儿嫂会怎么想？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 育儿嫂会感到安慰，她觉得雇主在关心她。\nB. 育儿嫂可能感到高兴，因为小明妈妈要提高她的工作待遇。\nC. 育儿嫂会感到压力，因为她觉得自己解决不了小明挑食的问题。\nD. 育儿嫂会感到愧疚不安，因为她没有尽自己的工作职责。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0021823927365160435,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e07bd6006945d27fc141","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367611529,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:26:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"02ea9f0e84a446908ae855dfb274ebc9"}